# Design handoffs dropped in the repo root. The .dc.html exports and mockup
# archives are working material from the Claude Design workspace — useful to
# have on disk, not something the repository needs a copy of. Name them
# explicitly rather than ignoring *.zip, so a zip that IS meant to be tracked
# is not silently skipped.
/*.zip
